# Settings Restructure & Dark Mode Implementation (Updated)

Restructure the Settings page organization and implement a functional, eye-friendly "Soft Black and Golden" dark mode.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Dark Mode Colors**: Background `#0A0A0A`, Surface/Cards `#1A1A1A`, Gold Accent `#D4AF37`.
> - **Print Safety**: Invoices will always print in light mode regardless of the UI theme.
> - **Full Scope**: Dark mode will apply to Login, Sidebar, Modals, Tables, and Mobile overlays.

